---
// src/pages/privacy-policy.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Cozivara Living"
  description="Privacy Policy and cookie disclosures for Cozivara Living in compliance with Google AdSense, GDPR, and CCPA guidelines."
>
  <section class="py-14 sm:py-20 bg-cozi-bg">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="mb-10 pb-6 border-b border-cozi-border">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-cozi-charcoal/70 block mb-2">LEGAL DOCUMENTATION</span>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-cozi-charcoal/60 mt-2">Last updated: April 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose-cozi max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>
          At <strong>Cozivara Living</strong> (accessible from <code>https://cozivaraliving.com</code>), the privacy of our visitors is one of our top priorities. This Privacy Policy document outlines the types of information that is collected and recorded by Cozivara Living and how we use it.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">1. Log Files</h2>
        <p>
          Cozivara Living follows standard procedures of using log files. These files log visitors when they visit websites. The information collected by log files includes internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), date and time stamp, referring/exit pages, and possibly the number of clicks. These are not linked to any information that is personally identifiable. The purpose of the information is for analyzing trends, administering the site, tracking users' movement on the website, and gathering demographic information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">2. Cookies and Web Beacons</h2>
        <p>
          Like any other website, Cozivara Living uses "cookies". These cookies are used to store information including visitors' preferences, and the pages on the website that the visitor accessed or visited. The information is used to optimize the users' experience by customizing our web page content based on visitors' browser type and/or other information.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">3. Google DoubleClick DART Cookie & AdSense</h2>
        <p>
          Google is one of our third-party vendors on our site. It also uses cookies, known as DART cookies, to serve ads to our site visitors based upon their visit to <code>cozivaraliving.com</code> and other sites on the internet. However, visitors may choose to decline the use of DART cookies by visiting the Google ad and content network Privacy Policy at the following URL: <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-cozi-olive underline">https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our advertising partners may include Google AdSense, media networks, and affiliate partners. Each of our advertising partners has their own Privacy Policy for their policies on user data.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">4. Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          Cozivara Living participates in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program and other curated affiliate programs. When you click on certain product links and make a purchase, we may receive a small commission at no additional cost to you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">5. CCPA Privacy Rights (Do Not Sell My Personal Information)</h2>
        <p>
          Under the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), California consumers have the right to request that a business that collects personal data disclose the categories and specific pieces of data collected, request deletion of data, and request that a business not sell the consumer's personal data. If you make a request, we have one month to respond to you.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">6. GDPR Data Protection Rights</h2>
        <p>
          We would like to make sure you are fully aware of all of your data protection rights. Every user is entitled to the right to access, rectification, erasure, restrict processing, and data portability.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-cozi-charcoal mt-8 mb-4">7. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have additional questions or require more information about our Privacy Policy or data protection practices, do not hesitate to contact us at <a href="mailto:cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com" class="text-cozi-olive underline font-medium">cozivaraliving2495@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
